# Sustainable Fashion Research Plan Revision Update<br>
<br>
## Introduction<br>
<br>
The previous research plan focused on sustainable fashion production methods. However, recent insights suggest that the impact of fast fashion on the environment is more significant than previously thought.<br>
<br>
## Revised Objectives<br>
<br>
1. Investigate the effects of fast fashion on the environment and human health.<br>
2. Develop a comprehensive list of sustainable production methods for the fashion industry.<br>
3. Identify potential collaboration opportunities with environmental organizations.<br>
<br>
